ced.","oracle_id":"b582e485-c024-47f0-ad6f-b918d32288ba","published_at":"2012-05-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"As Vexing Devil’s ability resolves, the next opponent in turn order (or, if it’s an opponent’s turn, that opponent) chooses whether to be dealt 4 damage, then each other opponent in turn order does the same. If any of them do, you sacrifice Vexing Devil.","oracle_id":"b582e485-c024-47f0-ad6f-b918d32288ba","published_at":"2018-12-07","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"No player may take actions between the time an opponent chooses to be dealt damage by Vexing Devil and the time you sacrifice Vexing Devil. This means that you can’t use a spell or ability (such as Turn to Mist) to stop Vexing Devil from being sacrificed if a player chooses to be dealt damage.","oracle_id":"b582e485-c024-47f0-ad6f-b918d32288ba","published_at":"2018-12-07","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
